    "All projects initialized with working code. Google ML Crash Course Weeks 1–4 modules done. Auth working in Ride App. DB with 10k+ rows in Inventory.",
    "Google ML Crash Course (developers.google.com/machine-learning/crash-course) · Flask Mega Tutorial Part 1–3 (blog.miguelgrinberg.com) · postgresqltutorial.com for SQL reference"))

